Package: jiangcheng-fisher
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Jiangcheng Fisher <fisher@jiangcheng.local>
Installed-Size: 3400
Depends: python3, curl, xdg-utils | www-browser
Section: games
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/
Description: 江城钓客 · 武汉江湖 3D 垂钓模拟 (Jiangcheng Fisher)
 3D fishing simulator based on real Wuhan waters (Yangtze, Han River,
 Liangzi/Donghu/Tangxun/Houguan lakes). Float & lure fishing,
 57 real fish species with photo cards, boat fishing, real-time
 weather & seasons. Runs locally in browser via python3 http.server.
